# Deploy ONLY the public website. Everything else in this folder — team
# notes (*.md), backups, the legacy Next.js app, local tooling — must never
# be uploaded: the CLI deploy ships the whole working directory, tracked or
# not, and anything uploaded is publicly downloadable at craftware.co.in/<path>.
# Whitelist approach, so a new stray file can't leak by default.
/*
!/craftware-design-v2.html
!/assets
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/vercel.json
